 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Shura Youjo no Eiyuutan ~Hanpa-sha to Iwa Reta Youhei, Youjo ni Tensei Shite Nariagaru~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "修羅幼女の英雄譚～半端者と言われた傭兵、幼女に転生して成り上がる～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Heroic Tale of Shura Young Girl: A Mercenary Who was Said to be Half-Baked is Reincarnated as a Young Girl and Rises to Success"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"If I had a second life, wouldn't I be able to aim to become a 'hero' again?\"\n\nSolfort Enuma is a veteran soldier who has spent over sixty years training to become a [Hero]. He is an ordinary man with no talent, but he never gave up and continued to pursue his dream. One day, Solfort faced off against the [Hero] he had always admired, but his sword failed to land a single blow and he met an unrewarding end... or so he thought, but when he woke up, he found himself reincarnated as a little girl--!?",
   "ja": "「もしも二度目の人生があれば、再び『英雄』を目指せるのではないか？」\n\n『英雄』になるため、六十年を超える歳月を鍛錬に費やしてきた老兵ソルフォート・エヌマ。彼は才能が無い凡人だったが、それでも諦めず夢を追い続けていた。ある日、ソルフォートは憧れ続けた『英雄』と対峙するも、彼の放った剣は一撃も届かずに報われない最期を遂げた…はずだったのだが、気が付くとソルフォートは幼女に転生していて――！？"
  },
